Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=41}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.80,0:01:49.97,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NFar away, but not long ago,\NZoro found himself trapped
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.97,0:01:53.48,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,on a certain gloomy island with Perona.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.53,0:01:59.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The heck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.63,0:02:01.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like a grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.29,0:02:03.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The question's who made it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.63,0:02:05.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NWhoever they are,\Nthey've got some skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.77,0:02:07.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was carved straight\Nout of that tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.90,0:02:11.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PERONA]\NI dunno if this is\N"good creepy" or "bad creepy."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.84,0:02:13.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.85,0:02:19.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.65,0:02:23.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.14,0:02:42.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it. He's strong, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.71,0:02:44.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.94,0:02:46.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:49.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PERONA gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.34,0:03:00.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.59,0:03:20.13,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NARRATOR]\NThis is Lazy Bones Island in\Nthe Land of Poverty, Hungeria.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.13,0:03:21.33,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sent here by Kuma,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.33,0:03:25.80,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Brook was mistaken for Satan\Nby the island's inhabitants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:38.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yawns]\NHow lovely!\NAnother perfect day!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.87,0:03:43.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.44,0:03:45.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORSHIPPER D]\NIt's the Longarm Tribe!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.01,0:03:46.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:50.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORSHIPPER E groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:52.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORSHIPPER F gags]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.54,0:03:55.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GIRL A]\NNo! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:03:57.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SATAN WORSHIPPER G screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:03:58.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.29,0:04:00.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're in trouble this\Ntime! You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.96,0:04:03.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORSHIPPER I]\NPut her down now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.03,0:04:05.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORSHIPPER J]\NWe're not gonna warn you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.17,0:04:07.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let my daughter go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.03,0:04:11.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've had enough of this!\NWe'll give you a taste of hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.61,0:04:16.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.45,0:04:20.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screams]\NDon't let them take me away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.66,0:04:23.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, they're really kidnapping\Nher, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.39,0:04:24.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORSHIPPER L]\NUh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.59,0:04:26.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEKKORI]\NUnless you curse them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.40,0:04:27.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, now is the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.90,0:04:29.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORSHIPPERS]\NMm-hm. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.63,0:04:32.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NNever mind that!\NShouldn't we be chasing them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.10,0:04:33.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GIRL A]\NLord Satan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.40,0:04:34.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NUh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.57,0:04:39.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.87,0:04:41.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you hear us, Satan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:42.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.06,0:04:44.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PEKKORI]\NDid you? We were cheering extra hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.39,0:04:46.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can save us now, oh Dark Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.66,0:04:49.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[WORSHIPPERS]\N– Give it your best!\N– Give it your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.10,0:04:53.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NOh... I see what got\Nthem in this situation now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:54.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're lazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.01,0:04:59.27,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NBut that young lady is still a victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.27,0:05:02.31,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't allow her to\Nsuffer such a cruel fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.31,0:05:05.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will save her. At the very least,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.11,0:05:08.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I owe for you the food.\NNot to mention the panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.21,0:05:11.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2100,0,1,\c&H000000&)}[WORSHIPPERS cheer]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:18.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[WORSHIPPERS]\N– Lord Satan! Lord Satan!\N– Lord Satan! Lord Satan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.49,0:05:21.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lord Satan! Lord Satan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.79,0:05:25.66,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NYou must forgive me, Luffy. Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:30.13,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Right now I'm rather busy being\NSatan in a sea of underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.13,0:05:32.84,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid our reunion\Nwill have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.84,0:05:36.24,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I owe my odd new friends\Na debt of gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.24,0:05:39.11,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,But I am confident that I\Nshall resolve this quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:41.49,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,and I hope you keep safe until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.67,0:05:53.64,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NARRATOR]\NDeep in the South\NBlue lies Birdie Kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.64,0:05:57.36,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}where a race of giant\Nbirds reign supreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.50,0:06:13.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[sighs]\NOh, man, I really\Nwant off this stinking island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:15.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(1685,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}This place is seriously the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.09,0:06:19.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NBirds treating me like I'm their toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.01,0:06:23.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And humans constantly trying\Nto eat me in a hot pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.52,0:06:29.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NIf that's not\Nbad enough, and it really is,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.56,0:06:35.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the birds and the humans won't\Nstop fighting each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.53,0:06:41.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:44.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chirps]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.44,0:06:55.44,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\Npositioned deep in the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.44,0:06:59.87,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}we find Peachy Island, home\Nof the Kamabakka Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.23,0:07:03.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI pants]\NWhere am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.97,0:07:05.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wasn't even looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:07.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Am I safe in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.91,0:07:10.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong\Nwith you psychos?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.67,0:07:11.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:13.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.12,0:07:26.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[groaning]\NOw.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.82,0:07:28.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CAROLINE]\NI've been waitin' for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.73,0:07:29.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NUh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:39.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You do not disrespect\Nher like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.67,0:07:42.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on. Who is this bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.74,0:07:58.61,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\N"Dear Nami and Robin, How are you?\NI hope this finds you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.61,0:08:01.81,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I do so look forward to\Nseeing the two of you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.81,0:08:07.08,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm certain when that time comes,\Nwe'll be better friends than ever before!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.01,0:08:28.12,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NFar away, but not long ago,\Non a Sky Island known as Weatheria.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.12,0:08:34.01,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,A weather wizard, or rather a weather\Nscientist, continued his studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.22,0:08:40.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HAREDAS]\NYoung lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.22,0:08:41.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.69,0:08:43.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:45.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NA ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.79,0:08:51.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWhoa. What the heck? It flies?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.32,0:08:57.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yelps]\NUh, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:01.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.86,0:09:03.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHuh? [screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.44,0:09:16.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the island I was\Nlooking for, let's land there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.06,0:09:21.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NIt's so dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.16,0:09:29.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAYOR]\NYou can save our island?\NAnd we're to believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.87,0:09:30.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HAREDAS]\NWhy not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:33.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, I'm an\Nexpert with the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.37,0:09:35.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll gladly summon a shower or two!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.50,0:09:39.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(663,1053)}- [VILLAGERS gasp]\N- [MAYOR] You jest!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:42.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, how about we make a little deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:44.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does a hundred million\Nberries sound fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.76,0:09:45.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:47.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(676,1053)}- [VILLAGERS gasp]\N- [MAYOR sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:51.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HAREDAS]\NHm? Did I highball it a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.81,0:09:55.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?!\NDo they look rich to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.42,0:10:01.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. Well, how does a hundred sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.03,0:10:02.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,- [NAMI] Huh?\N- [VILLAGERS] So cheap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.08,0:10:16.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that? Soap bubbles, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.82,0:10:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like there's something inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.92,0:10:21.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HAREDAS laughs]\NOne more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.69,0:10:25.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could you take this and generate\Nsome wind for me, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.73,0:10:31.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see... Do you want it full power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.17,0:10:32.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HAREDAS]\NBut of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.35,0:11:01.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[villagers gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.19,0:11:04.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rain clouds? But that can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.75,0:11:23.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[villagers cheer]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.17,0:11:25.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER B]\NIt's raining!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.63,0:11:28.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER C]\NYeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.51,0:11:30.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[children laugh]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:40.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HAREDAS]\NWhat did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.85,0:11:44.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.90,0:11:47.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They sure are happy, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.02,0:11:51.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HAREDAS]\NThe science of weather\Nhas many wonderful applications!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.64,0:12:03.07,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR]\NThis is the Mechanical Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.07,0:12:04.77,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Future Land Baldimore,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.77,0:12:08.04,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,also known as the\Nbirthplace of the Genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.42,0:12:14.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We better get him\Nto the hospital, Kitton.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.99,0:12:16.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KITTON]\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.64,0:12:41.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SURGEON 418A]\NWell, he's definitely a cyborg.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.25,0:12:43.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SURGEON 418B]\NI can't believe he runs on cola.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.85,0:12:45.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SURGEON 418C]\NWhat should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:48.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have any sodas to refuel him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:49.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SURGEON 418B]\NThere's no time to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.82,0:12:50.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:51.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SURGEON 418A]\NRight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.79,0:13:12.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.99,0:13:20.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello. You're the young\Nlad from earlier, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.96,0:13:24.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I do hope that I haven't\Nkept you waiting for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.66,0:13:27.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're definitely different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.30,0:13:29.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What did they do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.07,0:13:32.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NWell it seems that\Ncola is hard to come by here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.00,0:13:35.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so they brewed up\Nsome fine hot tea instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:37.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Darjeeling, to be precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.10,0:13:38.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hot tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.49,0:13:47.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The aroma and flavor are truly super.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.15,0:13:54.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lovely. There's really\Nnothing quite so relaxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.59,0:13:58.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.03,0:14:00.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, where are my manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:06.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NEnjoy. Careful, it's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.17,0:14:16.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, no, this is weird! It's all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.54,0:14:18.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mister! You're not funny now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.40,0:14:20.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I liked you more the way you were!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.24,0:14:22.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.05,0:14:48.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NIt's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.82,0:14:52.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How on earth I did I end up\Nout here in the elements?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:58.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! How lovely, a scarf for me? Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.27,0:15:07.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NOh my, oh my, oh my, oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.97,0:15:08.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.70,0:15:10.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This... This is the nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.81,0:15:20.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\N"Keep Out, this is an enclosed\Nforest of mechanical animals."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.62,0:15:24.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CYBORG ANIMALS clamor]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.36,0:15:37.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[cyborg animals growl]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.55,0:15:53.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ready for plan A: Surprise\NAwakening in the Jungle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.15,0:15:54.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Taromino pants]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:57.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KITTON]\NNothing's more wild than mecha animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:15:59.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This'll get him back on\Ntrack for sure! [laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.42,0:16:02.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now, let's all calm\Ndown, shall we be friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:04.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because you seem agitated this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.76,0:16:06.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you remember to eat your breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:09.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is the most important\Nmeal of the day, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.14,0:16:11.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's work on getting those\Nblood sugar levels up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:12.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[cyborg animals growl]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.89,0:16:17.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hold on a second, that means\Nit's breakfast time for me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.31,0:16:21.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahhh, you silly goose! Ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.73,0:16:29.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Delicious! No better way to start\Nthe day than with a cup of tea! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.79,0:16:32.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Would you care for\Nsome tea, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.66,0:16:40.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Let's cherish\Nevery moment, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.50,0:16:43.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KITTON]\NAh... It's not working!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.21,0:16:47.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kitton, Taromino gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.55,0:16:52.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,- [cyborg ape whoops]\N- [Kitton screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.77,0:16:57.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Kitton screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.53,0:17:13.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.03,0:17:18.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Violence is never the a...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.45,0:17:20.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Franky groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.74,0:17:24.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know that you're at an age\Nwhen you want to be naughty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.54,0:17:29.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But listen... we can...\Nsort this out...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.92,0:17:32.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,like gentlemen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.29,0:17:37.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing... good... ever\Ncomes... from violence!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.05,0:17:39.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, just fight back! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.76,0:17:42.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't reason with gorillas!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.05,0:17:43.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rela...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.76,0:17:46.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen to... Listen to what\NI to what I have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.10,0:17:51.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you'd let me talk... I\Nhave... wisdom to impart!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:54.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.32,0:17:59.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My friend... we must... not...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.73,0:18:02.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.76,0:18:21.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NOhh, yeah! Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.74,0:18:26.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.88,0:18:30.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who do you think I am,\Nyou punks, chopped liver?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.88,0:18:33.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't step to Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.72,0:18:37.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's back! You were seriously\Nstarting to scare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:40.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NOh yeah, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:44.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KITTON]\NWhat's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.23,0:18:48.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NI cooled off a bit and\Nran out of steam, literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.03,0:18:51.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? You mean... you're\Ngonna turn back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.35,0:18:55.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know just\Nthe place to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.53,0:19:06.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My Grandpa told me there's\Nsome dangerous stuff in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.37,0:19:10.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it's an emergency and I have you\Nto protect me, so it should be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.27,0:19:15.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[thud]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.85,0:19:33.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here's your breakfast,\Nlunch, and dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:35.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once you finish that, we'll\Nget back to our questioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.52,0:19:37.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can hardly wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.29,0:19:39.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CAPTAIN JERK chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.49,0:19:40.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.90,0:19:47.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN A]\NNot to intrude, but it sounds like\Nyou've been hurt pretty bad, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.90,0:19:48.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.97,0:19:50.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN A]\NJust a decrepit old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:53.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've only been in this\Ncountry for a single day now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.64,0:19:56.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but the guards in charge said\Nthe elderly are useless,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.34,0:19:58.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so they promptly threw me in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.38,0:20:00.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry to hear that.\NBut I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.93,0:20:03.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,- [explosion]\N- What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.50,0:20:04.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SORAN]\NAh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.26,0:20:09.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ARMY AGENT A]\NThere's a band\Nof dissidents running wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.59,0:20:13.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The warden called for backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:14.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He ordered all of us to get over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.83,0:20:15.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[SLAVERS]\N– Sir!\N– Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.34,0:20:21.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A band of dissidents?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.64,0:20:22.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CAPTAIN JERK]\NYes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.61,0:20:24.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we were quick to\Nfollow your orders, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.61,0:20:28.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All teams descended on the group,\Nso it didn't get out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.55,0:20:32.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SLAVER CAPTAIN]\NWhat're you talking about,\NI didn't give any orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.79,0:20:35.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me when you say "all teams",
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.52,0:20:38.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,do you mean the soldiers\Nstationed at the prison tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.23,0:20:39.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SORAN]\NHey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.61,0:20:46.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm an agent working for\Nthe revolutionary army.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.33,0:20:48.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.66,0:20:51.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You really think I give a\Ndamn about the dissidents?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.03,0:20:52.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take down Nico Robin\Non sight, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:20:56.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.70,0:20:59.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ARMY AGENT A]\NWith your command of our\Nforces, I know we can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.18,0:21:01.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN A]\NWell. You can count on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.98,0:21:03.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, before we go. Release\Nthe young lady from her cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.97,0:21:05.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's already been\Nthrough enough as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:14.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin! Kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.86,0:21:21.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And Clutch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.66,0:21:29.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[slavers groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.08,0:21:30.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[men gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.12,0:21:32.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Nico Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.83,0:21:46.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP sighs]\NWhoa! What the hell is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.50,0:21:51.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It smells so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.30,0:21:53.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who would eat bugs when\Nyou got stuff like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.80,0:21:57.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HERACLES]\NRamen Falls'n! Spaghetti Patches'n!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.34,0:21:59.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ham Fruits'n!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.51,0:22:02.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chocolate Rocks'n.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.24,0:22:04.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take whatever you want.\NIt's all safe to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.54,0:22:08.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I'm okay to eat this too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.26,0:22:13.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HERACLES]\NRight. Eat your fill!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.95,0:22:16.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once you've had enough to\Nbuild up your stamina,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.20,0:22:19.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the man-eating plants'n\Nwon't mess with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.07,0:22:20.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NSure, right, good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.49,0:22:23.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This stuff is so good I feel\Nlike I could eat forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.66,0:22:25.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HERACLES]\NEating's only the first step!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.37,0:22:27.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've gotta exercise, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.25,0:22:28.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWell, yeah, obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.71,0:22:30.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'm still on the first step here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.42,0:22:34.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've gotta bulk up so I can become a cool\Nhero of the forest like you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.84,0:22:44.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I can't eat another bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.58,0:22:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HERACLES]\NUsopp'n.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.02,0:22:49.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize fat things are the first\Ncreatures to be eaten on this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.95,0:22:52.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you talking about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.02,0:22:55.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HERACLES]\NIt's impossible to\Nescape from the Bowin Islands!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.69,0:22:58.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me that before?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.26,0:22:59.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HERACLES]\NAs for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.33,0:23:01.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the hero of the forest. Her...
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=42}===============================DIALOGUE============================
